f3: f3 (Fight Fake Flash)
f3:
f3: f3 is a simple tool that tests flash cards capacity and performance to
f3: see if they live up to claimed specifications. It fills the device
f3: with pseudorandom data and then checks if it returns the same on
f3: reading.
f3:
f3: F3 stands for Fight Flash Fraud, or Fight Fake Flash.
f3:
f3: Homepage: https://github.com/AltraMayor/f3
